  "articleBody": "Choose a backyard cottage provider by comparing site feasibility, design coordination, permit handling, construction scope, utility planning, and final inspection support—not just a preliminary price. In San Diego County, the correct path can differ between the City of San Diego, another incorporated city, and unincorporated county land, so request a property-specific review before approving plans.",
